{
  "Combat.GoblinElder.DrugDodged": "\nYou narrowly avoid the gush of alchemic fluids!"
  "Combat.GoblinElder.DrugHeat": "\nThe red fluids hit you and instantly soak into your skin, disappearing. Your skin flushes and you feel warm. Oh no..."
  "Combat.GoblinElder.DrugPoison": "\nThe greenish fluids splash over you, making you feel slimy and gross. Nausea plagues you immediately - you have been poisoned!"
  "Combat.GoblinElder.DrugShield": "\nThe liquid hits your shield and is harmlessly absorbed."
  "Combat.GoblinElder.DrugThrow": "{0} uncorks a glass bottle full of {1} fluid and swings her arm, flinging a wave of fluid at you."
  "Combat.GoblinElder.TeaseAfter": " The display distracts you long enough to prevent you from taking advantage of her awkward pose, leaving you more than a little flushed."
  "Combat.GoblinElder.TeaseAss": "{0} bends over, putting on a show and jiggling her heart-shaped ass at you. She looks over her shoulder and sucks on her finger, batting her eyelashes."
  "Combat.GoblinElder.TeaseBoneClad": "{0} runs her hands along her bone-clad body and blows you a kiss. [say: Why not walk on the wild side?] she asks."
  "Combat.GoblinElder.TeaseFlexibility": "{0} grabs her heel and lifts it to her head in an amazing display of flexibility. She lifts her loincloth and caresses her snatch and gives you a come hither look."
}
